# Lane w-seq — what must never be committed.
#
# CLAUDE.md: no build artifacts, no captured IL, no large binaries. The scan
# JSONLs are 60 MB each and every table in the rung regenerates from a scan; the
# objs are `cl.exe` output. `caps/*.excerpt.txt` IS committed — it is the hand
# verification, quoted in the rung, and it is a few dozen lines.
*.jsonl
*.obj
caps/*.text.txt
